# BarbarismJB — License Statement

**© 2026 Dvir Sasson (dviros). All rights reserved.**

## What this is

BarbarismJB is a security-research workbench for the Nintendo Switch 2,
published **source-available for research on hardware you own**. It is
derived work: the jailbreak engine is a port of the public ns2jb research
(kurumuz et al.), the entry research builds on CivSwitch (Gezine), and the
network rig reproduces techniques documented by the public captive-portal
research benches. See `PROVENANCE.md` for the full derivation tree.

